description:
### Description

[4.1.12 introduced a change in behavior in convertToCoreMessages](https://github.com/vercel/ai/pull/4591):

Specifically, when given assistant messages that have content and tool invocations, convertToCoreMessages now puts the tools before the content, when it used to put the tools after the content.

Unfortunately, this distinction matters for certain LLM vendors like Anthropic. Once the tool result is given for resubmission, we see messages like:

> An error occurred: The model returned the following errors: Your API request included an `assistant` message in the final position, which would pre-fill the `assistant` response. When using tools, pre-filling the `assistant` response is not supported.

### Code example

So this input:

```typescript
  const coreMessages = convertToCoreMessages([
    {
      role: "user",
      content: "request",
    },
    {
      role: "assistant",
      content: "response",
      toolInvocations: [
        {
          state: "result",
          step: 0,
          toolCallId: "tooluse_5oQ2pIcgQlOhVeq8dDlmhw",
          toolName: "toolName",
          args: {
            foo: "bar",
          },
          result: {
            other: "stuff",
          },
        },
      ],
    },
  ]);
```

Used to return:

```typescript
[
    {
        "role": "user",
        "content": "input asking for a tool"
    },
    {
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "response"
    },
    {
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": [
            {
                "type": "tool-call",
                "toolCallId": "tooluse_5oQ2pIcgQlOhVeq8dDlmhw",
                "toolName": "toolName",
                "args": {
                    "foo": "bar"
                }
            }
        ]
    },
    {
        "role": "tool",
        "content": [
            {
                "type": "tool-result",
                "toolCallId": "tooluse_5oQ2pIcgQlOhVeq8dDlmhw",
                "toolName": "toolName",
                "result": {
                    "other": "stuff"
                }
            }
        ]
    }
]
```

And now content comes after the tool calls:

```typescript
[
    {
        "role": "user",
        "content": "input asking for a tool"
    },
    {
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": [
            {
                "type": "tool-call",
                "toolCallId": "tooluse_5oQ2pIcgQlOhVeq8dDlmhw",
                "toolName": "toolName",
                "args": {
                    "foo": "bar"
                }
            }
        ]
    },
    {
        "role": "tool",
        "content": [
            {
                "type": "tool-result",
                "toolCallId": "tooluse_5oQ2pIcgQlOhVeq8dDlmhw",
                "toolName": "toolName",
                "result": {
                    "other": "stuff"
                }
            }
        ]
    },
    {
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "response"
    }
]
```

### AI provider

@ai-sdk/anthropic 1.1.5

